Resolve the bundled dinov2 repo against this file, not the process CWD.

Upstream pin: VGGT-Long @ c160869d1d99c96bb227f414afb3bc68c29c9a76

Upstream loads torch.hub from the relative path './LoopModels/dinov2', which resolves against the
working directory. Under reifyscene, VGGT-Long is never run from its own directory, so loop
closure breaks. Anchor the path to the module's own location instead.

Without it: loop closure fails whenever VGGT-Long runs from anywhere but its own directory, which
here is always.
diff --git a/LoopModels/backbones/dinov2.py b/LoopModels/backbones/dinov2.py
